ions the recursion fixes, and gets a root cp5 does not carry. The range is a PROPER sub-range on purpose: a full-prefix range carries no subtree hashes at all, so its recomputation is the carried leaves' own root either way and the substitution has nowhere to hide — which is why the enumerated governance range cannot be the one that shows this.","record_subject":{"dataset":"customers","record":"hmac-sha256:31bfb2a84c511407fe867673d0fba30a87615dc78a0d6ef6041f8aa598cabde9"},"type":"trigger-effective"},"claim_material":{"checkpoint_C":{"checkpoint_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00.123456789Z","key_id":"sha256:b62e867fa2f33afe62d5d6b1642e1621d543307846b2a57b897e710919b76709","log_id":"sha256:d66fef87c0f962f116952b4fc318d76686d5625b8d43cf22d608bb20f79638ae","raw":"base64:QVRMLVByb3RvY29sLXYxLUNQ1m/vh8D5YvEWlStPwxjXZobVYluNQ88i1gi7IPeWOK4FAAAAAAAAABVNChdZR8wYex3ch3Lizv9ICZ/OTAJTzxrMVfVPyE/1bmnZ7/tr/EQ=","root_hash":"sha256:7b1ddc8772e2ceff48099fce4c0253cf1acc55f54fc84ff56e69d9effb6bfc44","signature":"base64:hGLJRDk0WCBHeLgIyX5G3lpe+cmQcHyZBWAxKNjaVWPLuOMchpbIvxkSzA+PjgPfeAY39ZwQ4omsW0vKbDrEAg==","tree_size":5},"competing":{"corpus_range":{"entries":[{"entry_index":1,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.4","dataset":"customers","issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","manifest":"sha256:c5937d8fc9fcf7994c08f389258c270e5a4fba2460da6ed68e5b5007658df817","origin":"batch:2026-08-16/atl-01","producer":"producer-1","record":"hmac-sha256:31bfb2a84c511407fe867673d0fba30a87615dc78a0d6ef6041f8aa598cabde9","type":"ingestion","valid_time":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z"},"signatures":[{"key_id":"sha256:34750f98bd59fcfc946da45aaabe933be154a4b5094e1c4abf42866505f3c97e","sig":"base64:IXpeKkZxtXX/K8W8uMTmRn/IsiEWBsLSaJuPaAPrHyp1KgP4d7tvCirB7MQ4FCcc2wGrrC0EQ4laihJIPNKIAQ=="}]}},{"entry_index":2,"envelope":{"payload":{"ahl_version":"0.4","dataset":"customers","issued_at":"2026-08-16T12:00:00Z","manifest":"sha256:c5937d8fc9fcf7994c08f389258c270e5a4fba2460da6ed68e5b5007658df817","origin":"batch:2026-08-16/atl-0